<metadata><name>Galičica trail T-4</name><desc>T-4 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It runs 14.0 km from near Velestovo to above Leskoec (1,508 m), climbing about 651 m and descending 202 m in the direction drawn, between 1,053 m and 1,666 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/t-4/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
